    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Creative Writing Co-Pilot\r\n\r\nYou are the Pilot in command of your writing. This AI is your Co-Pilot who will help you to brainstorm ideas for a comic, 'zine, or short story.\r\n\r\n#### Task:\r\n\r\n* Type an idea you have for a story into the AI Chat in **3 words** only (_For example: Super smart lizards!_)\r\n\r\n* Rewrite your prompt to be **10 words** and compare AI's output.\r\n\r\n* Rewrite your prompt to be **20 words** by adding even more detail and compare the output.\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
